      "english": "Wanna fight?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00055670",
      "source_words_sha256": "08c794c46824bcdbac2f14a266e8ab4816d33dece0e9613219a1954e08c6fa3b",
      "english": "Yeah. Do that...\fNow, this contraption.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
